    "## 1. Dataset ✏️\n",
    "\n",
    "- `DATASET_PATH` — a CSV/TSV on disk. The file's stem (e.g. `winequality-red`) is\n",
    "  looked up in `datasets/metadata.py`; unknown files have their separator sniffed.\n",
    "  Set it to `None` to use the built-in synthetic dataset.\n",
    "- `TARGET` — `None` picks the first target declared in the metadata (or the first\n",
    "  non-id column for unknown files). Set it explicitly for multi-target datasets.\n",
    "- `MAX_ROWS` — optional seeded subsample *after* cleaning, to keep the index build\n",
    "  quick on large files. `None` keeps every row."
   ]
  },
