   "source": [
    "## 6b. Query by number of boxes\n",
    "\n",
    "Disjoint subsets of exactly `N_BOXES` boxes (one DNF conjunct each), run to\n",
    "exhaustion: the `N_BOXES` boxes whose union is closest to the target in TVD,\n",
    "then the best `N_BOXES` among the leaves not yet used, and so on, until the next\n",
    "result's TVD exceeds `TVD_THRESHOLD` or fewer than `N_BOXES` disjoint boxes are\n",
    "left. There is no size constraint, so subsets can differ in rows. Each rule is\n",
    "reduced with sympy (touching boxes can merge, leaving fewer than `N_BOXES`\n",
    "terms) and the results are sorted shortest simplified rule first (`RANK_BY`)."
   ]
  },
